id=selinux_seqno_fix
name=SELinux Seqno Fix
version=v0.4
versionCode=4
author=Andrea-Lyz
description=Restore SELinux /sys/fs/selinux/status policyload only when KSU stomps it to 0; real policy hot reloads (positive policyload writes) pass through unchanged so libselinux/servicemanager can still flush their AVC caches.
